From: Charles Hoskinson <charles.hoskinson@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 05:24:41 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] T8b GP-2: chip set 2 (the value set) of the slice leaf:
 CORE with XAdtEvalConstructNullary and KAdminPublishValue (three ROM reads,
 the constant vd as the Halted payload), a witnessed input val_d in INIT,
 DecVAir, rom::trace_h; example value_set (producer and consumer real proofs,
 four forged witnesses refused)

